# GitHub Fine-grained Personal Access Token
# 생성 방법:
# 1. https://github.com/settings/tokens?type=beta 접속
# 2. "Generate new token" 클릭
# 3. Token name: 적당한 이름 입력 (예: tweet-manager-release)
# 4. Repository access: "Only select repositories" → tweet-manager 선택
# 5. Permissions → Repository permissions:
#    - Contents: Read and write
#    - Metadata: Read-only (자동 선택됨)
# 6. "Generate token" 클릭 후 복사
GH_TOKEN=github_pat_xxxxxxxxxxxx
